claim:
    ? forall x,y R+, q R:
        q > 0
        x > y
        =>:
            x^q > y^q
    x^q > 0
    y^q > 0
    log(2,y) < log(2,x)
    q*log(2,y) < q*log(2,x)
    log(2,y^q) = q*log(2,y)
    log(2,x^q) = q*log(2,x)
    log(2,y^q) < log(2,x^q)
    by contra:
        ? x^q > y^q
        x^q <= y^q
        log(2,x^q) <= log(2,y^q)
        impossible log(2,y^q) < log(2,x^q)
